            <description sparkle:format="plain-text"><![CDATA[Menu Stats can now install new versions without opening GitHub.

Choose Check for Updates in the menu-bar panel to see the latest version, download it, and install and relaunch the app.

Automatic update checks are enabled by default and can be turned off in the panel. You choose when to install each update.

Update feeds and downloads are cryptographically signed. Resource readings stay on your Mac and system profiling is disabled.
]]></description>
